Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.53,0:02:20.50,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(443,474)\bord2.25\blur1.8\c&HFCFCFD&\pos(652.5,1050)}Operation Take Back Tokyo -Apocalypse-
Dialogue: 30,0:02:17.08,0:02:18.49,Dialogue Top,K,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:18.99,0:02:21.33,Dialogue Top,K,0,0,0,,Tokyo was supposed to be destroyed!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:21.33,0:02:23.50,Dialogue Top,K,0,0,0,,How is it back to normal?!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:24.96,0:02:27.67,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,It's not back to normal at all.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:33.59,0:02:34.68,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:36.39,0:02:38.51,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What you just saw
Dialogue: 30,0:02:38.51,0:02:41.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was an illusion created by magic.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:42.23,0:02:45.65,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,A reflection of what once was.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:46.06,0:02:47.90,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:48.31,0:02:50.78,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This city is a plant of sorts.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:51.07,0:02:52.53,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Just now, I excluded you
Dialogue: 30,0:02:52.53,0:02:56.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,from the effects of the magic field covering this area.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:56.78,0:03:01.79,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But they're all still under it, \Nseeing an illusion of peaceful days.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:02.20,0:03:05.29,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That allows me to efficiently and continually
Dialogue: 30,0:03:05.29,0:03:09.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,harvest their life energy.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:09.46,0:03:13.80,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The field absorbs the life energy,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:13.80,0:03:15.93,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,turns it into magical energy,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:15.93,0:03:18.47,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,and then sends it to Batlantis.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.39,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's a small area for now,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:21.39,0:03:23.56,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,but soon it will cover all of Tokyo.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:23.56,0:03:25.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Then, all of Japan.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:25.02,0:03:28.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,And eventually, the whole world will become a plant.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:29.65,0:03:31.15,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:31.15,0:03:34.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think their lives are?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:34.90,0:03:37.11,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You're always like this.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:37.11,0:03:41.08,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You just see everything as a subject for your experiments!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:41.78,0:03:46.08,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Me, Nee-chan, Amaterasu...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:46.54,0:03:48.58,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm taking you back with me!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:48.58,0:03:50.08,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'll {\i1}make you{\i0} tell me a way
Dialogue: 30,0:03:50.08,0:03:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to safely remove their Heart Hybrid Cores!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.09,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:56.01,0:03:57.09,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Those things
Dialogue: 30,0:03:57.09,0:04:00.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are unique artifacts even in the other world.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:00.39,0:04:02.14,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I simply used the cores
Dialogue: 30,0:04:02.14,0:04:04.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to create a system that would let a normal person
Dialogue: 30,0:04:04.60,0:04:08.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}utilize their life energy as a substitute for magical energy.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:08.94,0:04:11.15,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You didn't make them?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:12.19,0:04:13.32,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:14.11,0:04:17.11,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Th-Then how can they be removed?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:17.61,0:04:20.62,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,I just told you it's impossible.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:20.62,0:04:22.62,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Stop messing around!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:22.62,0:04:24.12,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Everyone is...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:24.12,0:04:25.62,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,They're all...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:25.62,0:04:27.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're all going to die!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:27.83,0:04:29.25,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Every last one of them!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:31.08,0:04:34.17,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,All humans die eventually, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:45.68,0:04:50.98,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,God damn you!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:59.95,0:05:01.16,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:03.41,0:05:08.62,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} will be your opponent now.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:09.62,0:05:11.04,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:15.88,0:05:17.67,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I can't fight here.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:17.67,0:05:19.97,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I can't get the people of Tokyo caught up in this.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:25.10,0:05:27.10,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You don't really think I'll let you get away, do you?!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:30.85,0:05:32.98,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Everything's going according to plan, isn't it?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:34.11,0:05:36.77,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Time for us to go.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:36.77,0:05:38.48,Dialogue,V,0,0,0,,Yes, Nayuta-sama.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:46.66,0:05:47.24,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Cra—!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:00.88,0:06:01.63,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Come...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:02.22,0:06:03.55,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Amaterasu!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:36.54,0:06:38.84,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Come get some.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:38.84,0:06:41.38,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I'll send you all to heaven.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:47.14,0:06:50.01,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You look like you could give me a good time.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:50.93,0:06:52.14,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:52.77,0:06:53.64,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:53.64,0:06:54.64,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:04.95,0:07:06.95,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,This is the Entrance Sealing Squad.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:06.95,0:07:09.28,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We're in the Yamanote Line area.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:09.58,0:07:10.49,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:10.49,0:07:12.91,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Continue your mission.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:13.75,0:07:15.21,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Magitech signals to the northeast!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:15.21,0:07:16.04,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:16.04,0:07:17.17,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,They found us?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:18.54,0:07:21.00,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Everyone, stay alert!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:21.00,0:07:24.05,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Work teams, get to it!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:24.30,0:07:26.30,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We'll defend this place to the death!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:36.31,0:07:39.31,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,That big one's tough.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:40.31,0:07:42.32,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,Those two were powerless against it.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:43.36,0:07:45.82,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,I'll just have to leave them to Kizuna,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:45.82,0:07:47.74,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,and buy some time!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.32,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Okay, here I come, fatass!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:55.58,0:07:56.54,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,She disappeared?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:58.33,0:07:59.08,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:08.97,0:08:12.47,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:24.73,0:08:25.86,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:31.24,0:08:32.62,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:33.16,0:08:34.74,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:35.87,0:08:37.37,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Just wait! I'll—
Dialogue: 30,0:08:40.54,0:08:43.13,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I told you I wouldn't let you get away.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:43.13,0:08:45.88,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll be taking that girl back with me.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:45.88,0:08:48.63,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,But the rest of you are apparently useless,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:49.30,0:08:51.14,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,so I'll eliminate you.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:56.06,0:08:59.14,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,If only I was...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:59.56,0:09:01.23,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,stronger...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:08.53,0:09:10.03,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:48.44,0:09:50.69,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia's sorry for being late, Captain!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:50.69,0:09:52.32,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:52.32,0:09:53.95,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Is that your...?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:54.49,0:09:55.45,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:55.83,0:09:56.95,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:56.95,0:09:58.45,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia's...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:58.45,0:10:00.45,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Heart Hybrid...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:00.45,0:10:01.41,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Gear!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:02.04,0:10:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taros!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:04.46,0:10:05.58,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Taros?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:07.29,0:10:09.96,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Just leave this to Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:17.39,0:10:18.64,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:19.68,0:10:20.77,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:20.77,0:10:22.31,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But don't take any risks!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:22.31,0:10:24.10,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That's an order!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:24.10,0:10:25.77,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:25.77,0:10:27.73,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sorry, Sylvia.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:29.65,0:10:30.32,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,How dare you...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:31.11,0:10:31.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:32.24,0:10:34.74,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,How dare you do that to me?!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:34.74,0:10:37.07,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia will protect everyone!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:37.07,0:10:41.12,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,She won't let you lay another finger on them!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:53.63,0:10:54.88,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Intercept!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:08.69,0:11:10.02,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Hit her!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:21.79,0:11:23.29,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I won't...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:24.87,0:11:27.04,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,lose to someone like you!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:27.50,0:11:29.04,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Someone like you...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:31.30,0:11:34.55,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Someone like you...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:34.80,0:11:38.80,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I refuse to lose to someone like you!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:40.55,0:11:44.81,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia also refuses to lose!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:47.81,0:11:48.81,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Impact!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:51.32,0:11:55.99,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Get away from here!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:12.54,0:12:14.17,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:15.21,0:12:17.17,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,What power...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:17.47,0:12:19.68,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That's... Taros...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:33.44,0:12:34.90,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I lost?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:34.90,0:12:36.32,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:37.19,0:12:39.74,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,That's impossible. Me?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:39.74,0:12:42.70,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,A member of the Royal Guard?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:43.16,0:12:44.20,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,To someone like her?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.70,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,No, that can't be!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:46.70,0:12:50.58,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than lose to a Lemurian.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:50.58,0:12:51.71,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:51.71,0:12:53.46,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll die!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:54.00,0:12:54.96,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:54.96,0:12:55.96,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:56.26,0:12:58.05,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,This is your fault!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:58.05,0:13:02.47,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,For doing this to me... To {\i1}me{\i0}!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:02.47,0:13:04.85,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,So it's all over!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:04.85,0:13:05.76,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,For you!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:05.76,0:13:06.97,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,For your friends!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:07.43,0:13:09.27,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,All of it!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:09.27,0:13:10.73,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Everything! Everything!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:11.52,0:13:12.98,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll blow everything away!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:13.98,0:13:14.98,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:14.98,0:13:18.49,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Inferno!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:24.28,0:13:25.45,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia won't let you!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:35.09,0:13:36.17,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:56.19,0:13:58.03,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The energy ball that just appeared
Dialogue: 30,0:13:58.03,0:14:00.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,has a calorific value of 7.2 exa-high-mega-joules!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:00.28,0:14:01.70,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,And it's still rising!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:01.70,0:14:05.70,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It will wipe out not only Tokyo, but the entire Kanto region!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:05.70,0:14:08.12,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia's shield is blocking it, but it's still hot!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:08.12,0:14:09.54,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Sylvia?!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:09.54,0:14:10.41,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:10.41,0:14:11.16,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:11.16,0:14:12.46,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:12.46,0:14:15.92,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Your shields probably can't handle it!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:15.92,0:14:17.96,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,But the people of Tokyo...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:19.71,0:14:21.34,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Sylvia will use her Immoral Weapon.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:21.34,0:14:22.22,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:22.22,0:14:24.47,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Wait, Sylvia!
