Dialogue: 30,0:14:24.97,0:14:26.72,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Just leave it to Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:34.02,0:14:35.48,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:37.48,0:14:39.48,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Shield generator, full drive!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:43.36,0:14:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Immoral Weapon:
Dialogue: 30,0:14:45.24,0:14:48.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Titania!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:11.01,0:15:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Full Power
Dialogue: 30,0:15:13.52,0:15:17.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ignition Impact!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:32.30,0:16:33.85,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:34.35,0:16:35.35,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:36.35,0:16:37.39,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:38.44,0:16:39.48,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:40.69,0:16:44.23,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Did Sylvia protect everyone?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:44.23,0:16:45.11,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:45.11,0:16:46.61,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You did great, Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:51.99,0:16:55.12,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Enough power to create a black hole...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.87,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,That was quite a splendid sight.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:58.33,0:16:59.87,Dialogue,N,0,0,0,,Until we meet again,
Dialogue: 30,0:17:00.21,0:17:01.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:08.63,0:17:10.63,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,They just keep coming.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:10.63,0:17:12.14,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,But our Counts...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:12.55,0:17:13.97,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,They're coming this way!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:13.97,0:17:16.14,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,We don't have time to resupply.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:16.14,0:17:17.77,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,I thought this might happen,
Dialogue: 30,0:17:17.77,0:17:19.43,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,so I've already taken measures.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:20.14,0:17:21.31,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Something's coming!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:24.94,0:17:25.40,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:25.65,0:17:26.57,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:26.57,0:17:29.65,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,A mid-range ballistic-type supply room.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:30.99,0:17:32.41,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,AKA The Bullet Love Room.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:32.78,0:17:36.08,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Start with the ones whose Counts are lowest.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.91,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,The others are to provide as much support as possible.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:38.91,0:17:40.25,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:40.25,0:17:42.58,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll start with Himekawa.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:42.58,0:17:44.17,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:44.46,0:17:46.21,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The others are to provide support!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:46.21,0:17:47.30,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:47.30,0:17:48.59,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Aine, Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:48.59,0:17:50.42,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Let's clear out the small fry!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:50.42,0:17:51.51,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:58.27,0:18:00.93,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:00.93,0:18:02.44,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,What's...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:02.44,0:18:03.94,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,going on...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:03.94,0:18:05.69,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,here?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:13.70,0:18:15.16,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:15.16,0:18:17.12,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,They're just having a wonderful dream.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:17.12,0:18:17.91,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:19.91,0:18:21.16,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:21.58,0:18:22.16,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,She disappeared?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:27.34,0:18:29.17,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Now, Lemurian,
Dialogue: 30,0:18:29.42,0:18:31.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what's your dream?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:32.92,0:18:33.68,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:01.24,0:19:02.75,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What is wrong with me?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:03.96,0:19:06.46,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,No... Not there...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:11.25,0:19:13.22,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.09,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,I can't concentrate...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:19.64,0:19:22.02,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,at a time like this?!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:23.48,0:19:25.73,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,Is it because I'm not strong enough?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:26.19,0:19:28.65,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,Fighting was all I had!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:28.65,0:19:30.23,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,But look at me now.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:30.90,0:19:35.03,Dialogue Italics,A,0,0,0,,In order to remain myself, I need power!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:39.83,0:19:41.54,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,I'll finish it now!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.29,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:53.80,0:19:57.43,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:13.65,0:20:15.36,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You're finally out.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:17.07,0:20:18.28,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Julicia!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:18.28,0:20:22.12,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Your Heart Hybrid always takes so long, Hayuru.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:22.12,0:20:24.58,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose you were having a good time.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:24.58,0:20:26.37,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Th-That's crass slander!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:26.37,0:20:31.79,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,{\q2}I would never do something as perverted as this... for fun!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:32.09,0:20:34.09,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:34.09,0:20:36.38,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Anyway, now that you've recharged, get to work.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:36.38,0:20:37.42,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:38.38,0:20:39.26,Dialogue Alternate,H,0,0,0,,Neros!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:40.64,0:20:41.18,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:59.07,0:20:59.86,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:04.45,0:21:05.70,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:07.58,0:21:10.12,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,A-Aine-san? What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:10.12,0:21:12.08,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be my turn next!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:12.08,0:21:13.04,Dialogue Italics,Y,0,0,0,,No fair, Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:13.04,0:21:14.92,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Talk about an annoying crowd.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:14.92,0:21:16.09,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 30,0:21:16.09,0:21:17.09,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:20.26,0:21:23.09,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna, do it with me right now.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:23.43,0:21:27.85,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Huh? But your Hybrid Count is still...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:28.43,0:21:31.69,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,To change the course of this battle,
Dialogue: 30,0:21:31.69,0:21:32.98,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I want the forbidden weapon.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:32.98,0:21:33.86,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:33.86,0:21:35.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:35.90,0:21:37.57,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I am who I am.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:37.57,0:21:39.61,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, that won't change.
