Dialogue: 30,0:23:29.93,0:23:32.72,Dialogue Lower,Preview,0,0,0,,that I was only here to protect you!
Dialogue: 30,0:23:32.72,0:23:35.39,Dialogue Lower,Preview,0,0,0,,Me, too. I was able to feel it...
